before the fixes
  reachable from internet: 10 nodes
  scheduler    2 hops:  internet =ssh=> login  login =job-submit=> scheduler
  storage      2 hops:  internet =ssh=> login  login =file-access=> storage
  registry     4 hops:  internet =ssh=> login  login =job-submit=> scheduler  scheduler =job-launch=> compute1  compute1 =image-pull=> registry
  bmc1         2 hops:  internet =web-dashboard=> monitoring  monitoring =management=> bmc1
  bmc2         2 hops:  internet =web-dashboard=> monitoring  monitoring =management=> bmc2
  admin-console not reachable
after fix: remove internet -> monitoring
  reachable from internet: 8 nodes
